OL,3,GNEWSASmoke warning as fire torches 200
OL,4,Atonnes of straw
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have been tackling a blaze
OL,7,Faffecting about 200 tonnes of straw.
OL,9,FCambridgeshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,10,Fsaid it broke out in Stow Road,
OL,11,FKimbolton, on Friday evening.
OL,13,F"It's likely to burn for some time, so
OL,14,Fsmoke will be seen for a number of
OL,15,Fhours," it wrote on Facebook.
OL,17,FPeople living nearby have been advised
OL,18,Fto close their windows and doors due to
OL,19,Fthe smoke.
